      en: "Jadran-Galenski laboratorij (JGL) is a dynamic Croatian pharmaceutical company based in Rijeka that has evolved into a global player since its founding in 1991. The company specializes in the manufacture of ophthalmological, dermatological, and ENT preparations, with the 'Aqua Maris' seawater-based product line achieving worldwide fame. The state-of-the-art 'Pharma Valley' research and production facility in Rijeka is considered one of the most advanced in Southeast Europe, integrating automated logistics processes. JGL is characterized by a strong export orientation, with markets in Eastern Europe, Russia, and the CIS states holding strategic importance. The company invests heavily in innovation and digital transformation to maintain its global competitiveness. By utilizing natural resources such as the mineral-rich water of the Adriatic Sea, JGL combines traditional knowledge with cutting-edge biotechnology. Sustainable growth and expansion into over 60 international markets make JGL a flagship company of the Croatian economy.",
